        <source>Well, thanks. You do have eyes for real art. Beautiful eyes, I gotta add. I did most of the graffiti in Core City. Actually, all of them. I'm the only writer around here. Oh, and I'm not counting what the Free Drones have been scribbling on the walls - that's amateur work!&lt;end&gt;</source>
